From 978ff1ae358f1325451d28aca4c3e69ca03e2d1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "vincent.yen" <vincent.yen@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 06:49:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add redfish bmc boot reason event logging

Track pending reboot reasons across BMC resets and report the final
reboot cause through the D-Bus property and Redfish event log.

Use /var/log/bmc_boot_reason_logged to distinguish firmware updates
and cold reset commands from watchdog resets. Cache the detected
reboot cause under /run/phosphor-state-manager after logging the
event, so restarting phosphor-bmc-state-manager restores the same
D-Bus property without generating a duplicate Redfish event.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]
---
 bmc_state_manager.cpp | 296 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 bmc_state_manager.hpp |  51 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 346 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

